Spec: Transformation Layer
Purpose: Transform and validate raw data fragments before delivery.

Platform: Go/Linux

Structure:
  ./mitm_transformation_main/
  ./migrations/

Owns:
  ./**

References:
  ./transformations_concept.md

Must:
  Strictly separate logging concerns: system_logs for lifecycle/errors, job_audit_logs for processing metrics, admin_audit_logs for manual triggers/config changes.
  Read raw fragments, map fields according to schemas, and apply validation rules.
  Report progress and errors back to the scheduler via IPC.
